# ripgrep (Claude Code's Grep/Glob tools) skips everything in .gitignore. The second-brain folders are gitignored on
# purpose (personal content must not be committed), but they must stay searchable, otherwise searches wrongly find nothing.
# .ignore has a higher priority than .gitignore, so these lines make the three folders visible to search only.
!10_raw_data/
!10_raw_data/**
!20_ai_wiki/
!20_ai_wiki/**
!30_outputs/
!30_outputs/**
